 "name": "H3V3HT2B",
 "kind": "tvs",
 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology Co., Ltd",
 "title": "H3V3HT2B: two-line bidirectional 3.3 V ESD protection diode, 100 pF max, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "Two bidirectional transient-voltage suppressors in a SOT-23, one from pin 1 and one from pin 2, both returning to pin 3. Each line stands off 3.3 V, breaks down between 5.0 V and 7.0 V at 1 mA, and clamps to at most 15 V at 25 A of 8/20 µs surge. Contact and air discharge to IEC 61000-4-2 are rated ±30 kV; junction capacitance is up to 100 pF. Listed applications: automotive, CAN bus, electronic control units, body, ADAS and powertrain control units.",
